From: Jerry Zhao <jerryz123@berkeley.edu>
Subject: [PATCH] Implement instruction-precise Sscofpmf counter 3
Purpose: Supplies a functional HPM counter with filtering and overflow interrupts.
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

Implement one 64-bit counter when Sscofpmf is selected. Event 1 counts
execution attempts (functional cycles); event 2 counts retired instructions.
Keep slots 4 through 31 absent. Sample privilege and inhibit before each
instruction, preserve CSR write priority, and deliver overflow at the next
instruction boundary even during multi-instruction processor steps.


